    "text": "<table class=\"dx-table\" style=\"margin:0 auto 1.2em auto;\"><tr><th><i>x</i></th><th><i>h</i>(<i>x</i>)</th></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1.23</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>1.54</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>1.94</td></tr></table>The table shows the exponential relationship between the number of years, <i>x</i>, since Hana started training in pole vault, and the estimated height <i>h</i>(<i>x</i>), in meters, of her best pole vault for that year. Which of the following functions best represents this relationship, where <i>x</i> ≤ 4?",
